        "en": "A large share of the fresh food comes from people in Lisky, Kiliya district — including the Hoffman family. Father Anatoliy of the Vincent de Paul monastery house, Ukrposhta volunteers, and other friends of the fund help too. Our job is to receive, sort, fill the gaps, and deliver."
